  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- 6-Passenger Low-Speed Vehicle<br>- Private Pool *Pool heating is available from October 1st through May 1st for an additional fee of $30 per day.<br>- 7 Adult Bikes<br>- Ping Pong Table and Corn hole<br>- Half mile to the heart of Seaside<br>- Outdoor Kitchen with Grill<br>- Walking distance to the Dogwood-Thyme beach access<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>Escape to Mississippi Queen, a 7-bedroom, 6.5-bathroom Seagrove Beach house that sleeps 21. Located 3 blocks from the Gulf and a short walk to dining and shopping, this home is excellently located for a relaxed beach retreat. Guests will love lounging by the pool and taking advantage of the multiple indoor-outdoor living areas.<br><br>Built in Old Florida style, this 5-level home epitomizes beachside living. The ground floor boasts a secluded outdoor space with a sparkling pool, loungers, an outdoor kitchen with a grill, and 2 patio tables seating 6 total. Inside, discover a game room, full kitchen, and 2 guest bedrooms with queen beds.<br><br>Gleaming hardwood floors, plush seating, and pastel blue walls create a serene environment for guests to gather in the main living area on the second floor. The large, open-concept kitchen is perfect for entertaining, with an oversized island that seats 4 next to a wine chiller. Steps away, enjoy boisterous group dinners at the 12-seat dining table. On the attached screened-in balcony overlooking the pool deck, curl up with a book on the cushioned porch swing or sip a glass of wine on the patio couch. This level has a primary bedroom with a king bed, reading nook, private bathroom, and access to the porch. This floor also offers a queen sleeper sofa for additional sleeping arrangements.<br><br>A second primary bedroom with a king bed and private bathroom is on the third floor, along with 2 guest bedrooms with queen bedsâ€”plus an XL twin bed in the hallway.<br><br>Discover a kid-friendly room on the fourth floor with 4 twin beds and 2 twin trundles.<br><br>Continue upstairs to indulge in a drink on the rooftop deck while taking in the sunset.<br><br>Mississippi Queenâ€™s gorgeous outdoor living areas, private pool, and quick beach access make it an idyllic Seagrove Beach escape. Easily explore the area thanks to on-site parking and 7 complimentary adult bikes. For beach access, Dogwood-Thyme Beach is a quick 6-minute walk. Take Forest Street east and turn right on Dogwood Street. At East County Highway 30A, turn left. The beach access will be on the right. Book today!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 21):<br>FIRST FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Additional Living Area: Full Kitchen, Game Room, and Half Bathroom<br><br>SECOND FLOOR;<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Separate<br>- Additional Living Area: Main Kitchen, Living Room, Dining Room and Half Bathroom<br>- Additional Sleeping Area: Queen Sleeper Sofa<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br>- Additional Sleeping Area: XL Twin Bed in Hallway<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: 4 Twin Beds and 2 Twin Trundle Beds, Shared Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>FIFTH FLOOR:<br>- Rooftop Patio<br><br>*The garage and carriage house are not for guest use.",
